<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-μήτριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>round the womb, concerning it,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.19
				</span></i>
			 acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.78
			</span></i> (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιμήτρια, τά,</span>
			<i>ship's bilge,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκοίλια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				4.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτηρ</span>) <i>by different mother,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				19
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
